.TH "nvme_init_set_features_spinup_control" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_spinup_control" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_spinup_control \- Initialize passthru command for Spinup Control
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_spinup_control
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "bool sce "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "sce" 12
Spinup Control Enable (SCE)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_SPINUP_CONTROL
